  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童DIY拼插建筑游戏套装",
    "en": "Kids DIY Construction Play Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童DIY拼插建筑游戏套装，采用PP结构件，适用于亲子互动、课堂活动和创意拼搭场景。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，适合4-6岁儿童进行拆装房子类搭建玩法。",
    "en": "This is a kids DIY construction play set made with PP structural parts, suitable for parent-child interaction, classroom activities, and creative building scenarios.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. It is suitable for ages 4-6 in detachable-house style construction play."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童DIY拼插建筑游戏套装采用模块化拼接结构，可用于帐篷、通道和互动空间等多形态搭建，适合儿童连续创意构建。",
      "产品可用于亲子互动、幼教活动与兴趣课堂，支持动手能力、手眼协调和合作玩法训练，适合重复拆装使用。",
      "包装为彩盒，配套体积与尺寸参数完整，便于渠道陈列、仓配管理和项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids DIY construction play set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports multiple layouts such as tents, tunnels, and interactive spaces for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It can be used in parent-child interaction, preschool activities, and hobby classes, supporting hands-on ability, hand-eye coordination, and collaborative play with repeatable assembly.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging and includes complete volume and size data for channel display, warehouse operations, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
